version: 2
title: A tiny venture
description: What we are, what can happen, and what each event shows. Everything this book shows is in it — paste it anywhere; answers taken are session-only.
decisions:
  - key: entity
    label: What are we?
    values:
      - { key: company, label: A company }
      - { key: partnership, label: A partnership }
events:
  - key: always
    label: Always
    trigger: imposed
    domain: Setting up
    detail: What holds whatever happens.
    content:
      key: standing
      label: Standing orders
      kind: md
      doc: |
        **Nothing here is generated.** Every document this book shows was written when the book was.
        File the annual return every twelve months from incorporation, once there is a company.
  - key: incorporate
    label: We incorporate
    trigger: chosen
    domain: Setting up
    detail: Chosen — it happens when we say so. On the table only as a company.
    when: [entity=company]
    hint: Have the name and the director ready, then take it.
    content:
      key: paperwork
      label: The paperwork
      kind: brief
      doc:
        title: Incorporation paperwork
        description: In the book itself.
        sections:
          - title: Reserve the name
            body: Check the register, then hold the name for 60 days.
          - title: Appoint a director
            body: One is enough to start. Add the second when there is a second.
  - key: paid
    label: Somebody pays us
    trigger: imposed
    domain: Money
    arity: many
    rate: 5/mo
    hint: Say what we are — the account differs.
    content:
      key: where-it-lands
      label: Where the money lands
      kind: md
      by: [entity]
      docs:
        entity=company: |
          Into the **company** account. Raise the invoice from the company first.
        entity=partnership: |
          Into the **joint** account. Both partners see it.
  - key: audit
    label: The tax office audits us
    trigger: imposed
    domain: Money
    content:
      key: what-they-ask
      label: What they ask for
      kind: playbook
      doc:
        version: 2
        title: An audit, as a book of its own
        events:
          - key: letter
            label: The letter arrives
            trigger: imposed
            content:
              kind: md
              doc: |
                Ask for 30 days. Gather the bank statements first, then the invoices; send the
                folder when it is one folder.
          - key: visit
            label: They visit
            trigger: imposed
            content:
              kind: md
              doc: Three letters, one visit, nothing owed — when the folder was ready.
